  "domain": "ai",
  "definition": "The core execution cycle of an LLM agent, in which the model emits a structured tool invocation, the harness executes it against the real environment (shell, file system, API, browser), appends the result to the conversation, and re-invokes the model \u2014 repeating until the model judges the task complete and returns a final answer; this iterate-observe-act loop is what turns single-turn text generation into grounded, autonomous task execution.",
